WEBVTT

00:05:56.185 --> 00:06:00.147
for larger, more productive assets ...

00:06:00.147 --> 00:06:01.399
until now.

00:06:02.024 --> 00:06:08.948
Our farmers are able to convert
15 goats into a solar water pump.

00:06:09.949 --> 00:06:11.075
Previously,

00:06:11.075 --> 00:06:14.912
these communities would rely on

00:06:14.912 --> 00:06:17.540
or wait for an NGO,

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.791
a charity

00:06:18.791 --> 00:06:22.586
or the government to take notice

00:06:22.586 --> 00:06:24.880
and give them what they needed.

00:06:25.214 --> 00:06:31.053
Now they are using their own resources